      "side": 1,
      "message": "Client code sees SkCaptureAsset as an incomplete type, and wrapping it in a templated SkTArray feels like a code smell.\n\nI saw that `TaskList` and `UploadList` in `graphite::Recorder`\u0027s header wrapped the TArray in an object, but then I also see that we have `skia_private::TArray\u003csk_sp\u003cDevice\u003e\u003e fTrackedDevices;` where we have the raw TArray. I was just a bit confused as to the difference.",
      "parentUuid": "23b60de6_36de9aef",
      "revId": "9dbdc7e40f117dea0e4cd4e017f0a160c19788c5",
